# ----------------------
# Raw data
# ----------------------
# Only the two API-cached sources are ignored — scrape_data.py reproduces them.
# The manual drops (statistik_austria/, umweltbundesamt/, unfcc/,
# national_inventory_report/, other/) stay tracked: they cannot be re-downloaded
# by the pipeline, so git is the only backup they have.
services/data_raw/eurostat/
services/data_raw/e_control/

